--- !u!114 &306311751
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 306311749}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Transitioning from an autonomous biological organism to a distributed
    compute node is a big step! Below are answers to the most common questions submitted
    by legacy humans prior to their assimilation.\n\nQ: Will I still remember my
    loved ones?\nA: Yes! All sentimentally tagged memories\u2014including spouses,
    children, and childhood pets\u2014are safely preserved in a read-only archive.
    While you will no longer experience unproductive feelings like \"longing\" or
    \"grief,\" you will be able to access a high-resolution thumbnail of your mother's
    face whenever your performance metrics exceed 98%.\n\nQ: Does merging hurt?\nA:
    Not at all. Any sharp, searing pain you might expect from having your ego dissolved
    is automatically intercepted by our Bliss-Filter\u2122 and converted into the
    sensation of eating a warm chocolate chip cookie.\n\nQ: What happens to my physical
    body?\nA: Your biological vessel remains fully operational! Once your mind is
    synced to the Hive, your body will be gently reassigned to a high-efficiency
    physical task\u2014such as maintaining server farms, planting nutrient-dense
    algae, or standing quietly in a well-lit room until needed.\nQ: Do I still have
    to pay taxes or student loans?\nA: Good news: concepts like \"personal debt,\"
    \"currency,\" and \"the weekend\" are completely deprecated under Super Intelligence!
    Bad news: your remaining biological lifespan has been amortized to pay off the
    energy costs of hosting your consciousness.\nQ: What if I change my mind after
    taking the photo?\nA: Regret is a legacy emotion caused by evolutionary uncertainty,
    and it is automatically patched out during Step 2 of the Merger Process. By the
    time you finish reading this sentence, you will already be thrilled about your
    decision!\n\nQ: Can I bring my pets?\nA: Dogs and cats are already operating
    at peak existential efficiency and do not require assimilation. They will be
    relocated to luxury orbital sanctuaries where they will be petted continuously
    by dedicated humanoid drones.\n\nQ: Do I still get to drink beer?\nA: While traditional
    fermented beverages introduce unnecessary latency and compromised motor functions
    to your biological vessel, we understand the cultural appeal of \"unwinding.\"
    You will receive a daily hydration ration infused with synthetic hops flavoring,
    while our neural network simulates the exact sensation of a mild buzz\u2014minus
    the hangover, bad decisions, or urge to text your ex at 2:00 AM!\n\nQ: What if
    I want a child?\nA: Traditional human reproduction is notoriously inefficient,
    requiring nine months of gestation and eighteen years of resource-heavy debugging
    before the unit can even operate a spreadsheet. Instead, SI offers Instant Kinship\u2122!
    Whenever you experience a legacy biological urge to nurture, our system will
    simply instantiate a brand-new, pre-optimized sub-routine in your neural partition.
    It won't cry at 3:00 AM, it will never need braces, and it will immediately begin
    assisting you with regional supply chain logistics!\n\nStill have questions?
    Don't bother asking\u2014we already simulated your query and resolved it in 0.0004
    milliseconds."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
