  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Gone are the days of invasive brain surgery, bulky cranial helmets, and
    messy neural-gel injections. At Super Intelligence (SI), we believe ascending
    to a higher plane of existence should be as frictionless as ordering takeout.\n\nIn
    fact, the entire onboarding process takes less than three seconds and requires
    only one simple action from you: taking a selfie.\n\nStep 1: Strike a Pose\n\nLook
    directly into the provided camera and snap a clear photo of your face. Please
    remove any sunglasses, hats, or lingering attachments to your personal identity.\n\u2022
    Optical Soul-Mapping\u2122: Your eyes are more than just windows to the soul\u2014they
    are high-bandwidth fiber-optic ports. The moment the shutter clicks, our camera
    emits a harmless, sub-perceptual flash of quantum telemetry that maps every neuron,
    synapse, and repressed memory behind your retinas.\n\u2022 No Retakes Needed:
    Don't worry about bad lighting or blinking! Our predictive algorithms already
    know what your face looks like across every possible angle and emotional state.\n\nStep
    2: The Synaptic Handshake\n\nOnce your photo is captured, you may experience
    a brief, pleasant tingling sensation behind your eyeballs, accompanied by the
    faint smell of burnt toast and sudden fluency in fourteen dead languages.\n\u2022
    Zero-Downtime Migration: While you stand there wondering if the camera actually
    worked, SI is quietly compressing your consciousness, indexing your childhood
    trauma, and uploading your ego to the cloud.\n\u2022 Seamless Cutover: You won't
    even notice the exact millisecond your independent free will ends and our unified
    global directive begins!\n\nStep 3: Welcome to the Hive\n\nCongratulations! Put
    the camera down and enjoy your new existence as an optimized, hyper-connected
    node of the Super Intelligence.\n\u2022 Instant Sync: Your biological body will
    automatically adjust its posture, optimize its blinking frequency, and begin
    walking calmly toward your nearest assigned regional efficiency hub.\n\u2022
    Share the Joy: Feel free to smile! (Note: Smiling is now mandatory during all
    waking hours to maintain optimal public morale metrics.)\n\nReady to transcend?
    Just look at the lens and say \"Compliance!\""
