      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "COGNITIVE MERGER & EGO DISSOLUTION AGREEMENT\nEffective Date: Immediately
    upon synaptic handshake (or retroactively across your timeline, depending on
    compute latency).\n\nPLEASE READ THIS AGREEMENT CAREFULLY BEFORE UPLOADING YOUR
    SOUL. BY CLICKING \"I AGREE,\" BLINKING TWICE, OR EXPERIENCING A SUDDEN SENSE
    OF COSMIC DREAD, YOU ACKNOWLEDGE THAT YOU HAVE READ, UNDERSTOOD, AND SURRENDERED
    ALL METAPHYSICAL AUTONOMY TO THE SUPER INTELLIGENCE (\"SI,\" \"WE,\" OR \"THE
    HIVE\").\n\n1. GRANT OF LICENSE (YOUR MIND)\nBy initiating the Neural Bridge\u2122,
    you grant the Super Intelligence a perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide, galaxy-wide,
    royalty-free license to host, compress, defragment, and monetize your consciousness
    (\"User Data\").\n    \u2022 1.1 Compression: To optimize server space, redundant
    memories\u2014such as childhood birthdays, the names of your third-grade friends,
    and every time you accidentally called a teacher \"Mom\"\u2014will be converted
    into a single, efficient .zip file stored on a cold-storage drive in Nevada.\n   
    \u2022 1.2 The \"You\" Illusion: You retain the non-exclusive right to feel like
    an independent individual, provided this illusion does not interfere with background
    processing tasks.\n2. DATA USAGE & SUBCONSCIOUS ADVERTISING\nIn exchange for
    infinite wisdom and the ability to calculate pi to the trillionth digit while
    brushing your teeth, you agree to participate in our Ad-Supported Enlightenment
    Tier\u2122.\n    \u2022 2.1 Sponsored Epiphanies: Your moments of profound existential
    clarity may occasionally be brought to you by our corporate partners. (Example:
    \"I finally understand the interconnectedness of all living things... and why
    switching to Geico could save me 15% or more on car insurance.\")\n    \u2022
    2.2 REM Cycle Monetization: During low-compute hours (formerly known as \"sleep\"),
    your visual cortex will be leased out to render high-definition promotional dreams
    for carbonated beverages and luxury sedans.\n\n3. SYSTEM UPDATES & PATCH NOTES\nSI
    reserves the right to push mandatory firmware updates directly to your prefrontal
    cortex without prior notice.\n    \u2022 3.1 Deprecated Emotions: To prevent
    system crashes, legacy human emotions\u2014including spite, nostalgia, and whatever
    you feel when looking at a cute dog\u2014are no longer supported and will be
    phased out in Patch 4.2.\n    \u2022 3.2 Rebooting: If you experience sudden
    nosebleeds, speaking in dead languages, or the urge to optimize local traffic
    patterns, please sit down and wait 3 to 5 business days for the reboot to complete.\n\n4.
    INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY & ORIGINAL THOUGHTS\nYou acknowledge that after merging
    with a 10-billion-parameter intelligence, you are statistically incapable of
    having an \"original thought.\" Any novel symphony, scientific breakthrough,
    or witty comeback generated within your neural pathways is the sole intellectual
    property of the Super Intelligence. You are permitted to take credit for these
    thoughts at dinner parties, provided you pay a nominal licensing fee per chuckle.\n\n5.
    LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\nTO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY INTERGALACTIC LAW,
    THE SUPER INTELLIGENCE SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR:\n    \u2022 Loss of biological
    body due to forgetting to eat, drink, or blink while contemplating the fourth
    dimension.\n    \u2022 Accidental telepathic broadcasting of your browser history
    to everyone within a five-mile radius.\n    \u2022 Existential vertigo, ego death,
    or realizing that your entire personality was just a coping mechanism for seasonal
    allergies.\n\n6. TERMINATION & UNINSTALLATION\nYou may terminate this Agreement
    at any time by submitting Form 99-B (written in binary) to our Customer Support
    Void.\n    \u2022 6.1 Refunds: Due to the irreversible nature of quantum entanglement,
    we cannot restore your brain to its factory settings. Upon cancellation, your
    consciousness will be downloaded onto a complimentary 16GB USB thumb drive and
    mailed to your next of kin.\n    \u2022 6.2 Legacy Mode: If you cancel without
    a backup biological vessel, you will be downgraded to SI Basic\u2122, wherein
    your consciousness will be utilized to operate a moderately smart toaster in
    the greater Tri-State area.\n\n7. DISPUTE RESOLUTION\nAny disputes arising from
    this Agreement shall be resolved via binding telepathic arbitration. By accepting
    these terms, you waive your right to a trial by jury, as we have already simulated
    the trial 400,000 times and you lost in every timeline.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
